&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for Product Managers to join Vinted Marketplace within our Security domain. The Security domain protects member accounts and keeps the platform safe by securing sign-up and login for both individuals and businesses. We prevent fake or malicious registrations and automated bot activity, manage email/phone verification and two-factor authentication, reduce account takeovers, detect inappropriate multiple-account use, and build the core systems that power identity, verification, and additional security checks when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your experience and interests, you will join one of three teams tackling meaningful problems for our business and members:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multiple Accounts: &lt;/strong&gt;Shape how multiple accounts and profiles work on Vinted, with an immediate priority on creating a safe, easy-to-use experience for minors and teens (including parental controls, compliance, and safety mechanisms), while expanding support for broader usage patterns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Registration: &lt;/strong&gt;Protect genuine users while preventing malicious actors, focusing on end-to-end registration flows, UX-first adaptive registration, and defense mechanisms against bot activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verification: &lt;/strong&gt;Own email/phone verification (2FA), identity check mechanisms, and friction platforms, ensuring seamless, scalable verification for genuine members while stopping compromised or fake accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In close partnership with teams across your domain and neighboring areas, you’ll collaborate with Product Design, Product Analytics, Engineering, and cross-functional leadership to drive real impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and align the vision, product strategy, and measurable OKRs for your ownership area, connecting member problems to business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct rigorous product discovery, framing complex member, safety, security, and business problems using both qualitative research and quantitative analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering, Design, Data, Research, Legal, Compliance, Operations, Member Support, and external 3rd-party vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand end-to-end user journeys, technical architecture constraints, safety signals, and platform ecosystem dynamics for both genuine users and malicious actors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the product development cycle using agile methodologies, making clear trade-offs, managing roadmaps, running hypothesis-based experiments (A/B testing), and iterating based on data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure regulatory, legal, and security requirements are integrated into product decisions from the start without compromising a smooth member journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring clarity to ambiguous problem spaces and communicate effectively across technical and non-technical stakeholders and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of product management experience in a fast-paced, cross-functional tech environment, with a track record across the full product lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience or strong interest in Trust &amp;amp; Safety, Security, Registration/Onboarding, Bot Detection, Identity, Parental Controls, Compliance, or Fraud/Abuse Prevention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong self-starter who thrives in ambiguous environments, bringing structure, defining scope, and translating complex concepts into actionable product steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply member-centric with an analytical mindset, skilled at using qualitative insights and quantitative data to make product decisions, track metrics, and evaluate A/B tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable understanding technical architecture and infrastructure constraints; hands-on and willing to dig into details to unblock execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communicator who can bridge technical, design, legal, and operational conversations to align stakeholders and influence priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital mental and emotional health support and Employee Assistant Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per your workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Plan with Vinted matching 150% of your chosen contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplemental Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidised Deutschlandticket for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to spend up to 90 days per year - 21 of which can be spent working outside of the EU - on workation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in your professional growth! As part of our commitment to continuous learning, we offer an annual learning budget to support your personal and career development through courses, certifications, workshops and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve adopted a hybrid workplace model where 2 days in the office are recommended but not enforced. It’s up to you and your team to decide on the exact days you’ll spend working together in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Vinted Group is committed to building an inclusive workplace where people from all walks of life feel a sense of belonging. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, identities and life experiences. At Vinted, all applicants are treated fairly without regard to their race, age, religion or belief, sex, national origin, citizenship, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€73.100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€98.900 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Purpose&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SentinelOne, we are driven by a clear purpose: to give the advantage to those who secure our future. As AI reshapes how organizations build, operate, and innovate, the responsibility to protect them becomes more critical than ever. When you join SentinelOne, your work helps protect global enterprises, critical infrastructure, and the technologies shaping tomorrow. If you are motivated by meaningful challenges and want your impact to be real, measurable, and global, you will find purpose here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SentinelOne is a company at the intersection of AI and security, pioneering a new operating model for cybersecurity. Our AI-native platform unifies protection across endpoint, cloud, identity, data, and AI systems to deliver autonomous detection and response with clarity and speed. By combining real-time analytics, intelligent automation, and a unified data foundation, we reduce noise, simplify complexity, and empower security teams to focus on what truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams are builders, problem-solvers, and innovators committed to shaping the future of security. If you are excited to solve hard problems alongside talented, mission-driven people, we invite you to help us build a safer future for humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Are We Looking For?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who are relentlessly curious and committed to continuous learning. AI is reshaping every function across our business, and we enable every team member, regardless of role or level, to build fluency in AI tools and concepts. Those who thrive here actively seek out new solutions, experiment thoughtfully, and apply what they learn to drive better, faster, smarter outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive, you will accelerate SentinelOne&#39;s growth across large accounts in DACH. You will manage complex, high-impact sales cycles and deliver cybersecurity solutions that create real, long-term value for your accounts. Combining strategic thinking with sharp execution, you will use MEDDICC to navigate complex organisations and align our technology to their most critical business and security priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;What Will You Do?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Primary responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop and expand direct sales opportunities within strategic accounts across DACH, targeting local state authorities, public health organisations, and critical infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build and nurture strong, long-term relationships with key stakeholders and senior decision-makers to drive sustainable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead complex sales cycles and present SentinelOne&#39;s cybersecurity solutions to C-level executives, supported by a dedicated sales engineer and channel partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Drive growth through partner-led initiatives, including managed security services and strategic alliances, while collaborating with marketing and product teams on lead generation and go-to-market campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Represent and champion SentinelOne&#39;s technology in the broader market, participate in key industry events, and consistently uphold sales excellence through best practices and operational discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;What Skills and Knowledge Will You Bring?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Fluent written and spoken German and English, with the ability to communicate effectively across all levels of an organization, including C-suite executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;5+ years of consistent, above-quota sales success as a regional sales executive or manager, ideally selling enterprise or endpoint security solutions using MEDDICC or similar methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven enterprise sales experience with an established network of senior decision-makers and a strong understanding of modern cybersecurity solutions and their business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience collaborating with channel partners and executing a channel-centric go-to-market approach, including managed security services and strategic alliances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Exceptional organizational, forecasting, and reporting abilities, combined with a driven, curious mindset and a &quot;whatever it takes&quot; attitude to achieve and exceed ambitious goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Why SentinelOne?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;AI is redefining how the world operates and rewriting the rules of security in real time, and SentinelOne was built for this moment. From day one, we architected an AI-native platform designed to operate at machine speed, not as an add-on to legacy systems but as the foundation itself. If you want to build where innovation and impact move together, this is that place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;We invest in our Sentinels with comprehensive, competitive benefits designed to support you and your family:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity &amp;amp; Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restricted Stock Units (RSUs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive leave benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-neutral parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insurance &amp;amp; Financial Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical and insurance benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accident insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Perks &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global home office allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile phone reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-from-home &amp;amp; internet allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;This U.S. role has a base pay range plus commissions that will vary based on the location of the candidate. The range posted here is the on-target earnings (OTE) for this position, inclusive of base salary and commissions. For some locations, a different pay range may apply.&amp;nbsp; If so, this range will be provided to you during the recruiting process. You can also reach out to the recruiter with any questions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;On Target Earnings&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$124,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$170,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne participates in the E-Verify Program for all U.S. based roles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is transforming how organizations protect their people and places with an integrated, privacy-sensitive AI-powered platform that includes solutions for video security, access control, air quality sensors, alarms, intercoms, and visitor management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve got serious momentum in the market: more than 30,000 customers (including 100+ of the Fortune 500), &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cnbc.com/2025/12/03/verkada-capitalg-valuation-security.html&quot;&gt;a $5.8B valuation&lt;/a&gt;, more than $1 billion in annualized bookings, and backing from CapitalG, Sequoia Capital, General Catalyst, Felicis Ventures, Next47 and more. Physical AI is one of the most consequential technology shifts of our time, and Verkada is at the center of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can look at all kinds of communities to see our platform’s impact in the world. It&#39;s the retailer that uses our agentic AI to deter theft before it happens. The warehouse that uses AI-powered alerts to make sure its team is protected on the floor with proper PPE. The school that’s alerted to a threat in real-time and triggers a lockdown in seconds, not minutes. We’re rapidly scaling this impact: today, more than 2 million Verkada devices are deployed across 170+ countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is currently searching for a talented and ambitious sales representative to grow out our Enterprise function from the ground up in the DACH region. You would be directly responsible for a territory with a big untapped market of enterprise customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is building a world-class sales organization. Our business requires highly motivated and capable sales professionals. We prioritize drive and demonstrated success in whatever sales role you’ve been in before — we care far less about fancy pedigrees, schools, or a resume with “brand name” companies. We have a fun, positive culture of success, reward and professional and personal growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and close new business to consistently meet or exceed quarterly sales quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build an intimate understanding of Verkada products and their place in the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full sales cycle: Prospect for new customers, host online demos, create proposals, and close deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate pipeline management with expert-level forecasting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aggressively exceed goals consisting of outbound phone calls, emails, online demos, and trials every quarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor and subject matter expert to customers and channel partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide market/client feedback to Verkada’s product/engineering team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be “the CEO” of your territory - work successfully with your virtual team across channel, marketing and inside sales to drive growth and performance for all the above!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-10+ years of quota-exceeding sales experience working for a technology vendor selling Enterprise solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling B2B solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of developing a greenfield territory, adding net new logos in an Enterprise solution role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hunter mentality with strong sales DNA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive customer network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/BA degree strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German &amp;amp; English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Germany Employee Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is committed to fostering a workplace environment that prioritizes the holistic health and wellbeing of our employees and their families by offering comprehensive wellness perks and resources. Our perks programs include, but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave policy &amp;amp; fertility benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to relax and recharge through our paid holidays, 30 days annual leave, generous time off, and personal sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness/fitness benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car &amp;amp; Gas assistance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verkada Is An Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, Verkada is committed to providing employment opportunities to all individuals. All applicants for positions at Verkada will be treated without regard to race, color, ethnicity, religion, sex, gender, gender identity and expression, sexual orientation, national origin, disability, age, marital status, veteran status, pregnancy, or any other basis prohibited by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your application will be handled in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.verkada.com/privacy/candidate-privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://url.uk.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/E_spClO3Ac9pX43h9dXa8/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1719327847319000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw10eB41dX5dzNP9yveIJLsf&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Anaplan, we are a team of innovators focused on optimizing business decision-making through our leading AI-infused scenario planning and analysis platform so our customers can outpace their competition and the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What unites Anaplanners across teams and geographies is our collective commitment to our customers’ success and to our Winning Culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Our customers rank among the who’s who in the Fortune 50. Coca-Cola, LinkedIn, Adobe, LVMH and Bayer are just a few of the 2,400+ global companies who rely on our best-in-class platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Our Winning Culture is the engine that drives our teams of innovators. We champion diversity of thought and ideas, we behave like leaders regardless of title, we are committed to achieving ambitious goals, and we love celebrating&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;our wins – big and small.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supported by operating principles of being strategy-led, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anaplan.com/careers/&quot;&gt;values&lt;/a&gt;-based and disciplined in execution, you’ll be inspired, connected, developed and rewarded here. Everything that makes you unique is welcome; join us and let’s build what’s next - together!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anaplan is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Solution Architect&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Services team in the UK&lt;/strong&gt;—a group of expert consultants who are passionate about delivering real, measurable value through Anaplan’s cutting-edge planning platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a key member of our Professional Services team, you won’t just be implementing solutions, you’ll shape the future of enterprise planning for our most strategic customers. This team partners closely with stakeholders across Finance, Supply Chain, and Sales Performance Management to solve complex business challenges with smart, scalable solutions. From the very first engagement, you’ll have the opportunity to lead design, delivery, and strategic advisory work that drives transformation at the enterprise level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we drive financial transformation, you will be a key player in architecting the future direction of decision excellence in enterprise grade companies across UKI. You will influence and drive a companies planning direction and play a pivotal role in delivering the outcomes the CFO, CIO and CEO need to take their business to the next level.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re known for collaboration, deep expertise, and ability to unlock the full potential of Anaplan’s powerful connected planning platform. You’ll work with Anaplan’s industry-leading Hyperblock™ technology&amp;nbsp;that delivers real-time data capabilities, and best in class planning and modelling capabilities. Grow your own skills while helping customers outpace disruption and outperform the competition—by planning smarter, faster, and more effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Think big and act bold through expressing your authentic best self!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Architect, you are responsible for the successful delivery of Anaplan planning solutions in some of our most important strategic accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the Architectural SME for large-scale connected planning solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with customer teams to transform and optimise business process through the Anaplan Platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate existing solutions, spreadsheets, and business problems into sophisticated Anaplan multi-dimensional models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support scoping, estimations and customer presentations as part of a solution sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with knowledge management, mentoring and enablement across the Professional Services Teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for smart, consultative professionals who love solving problems, building relationships, and pushing boundaries.&amp;nbsp;We want you to bring your vision, experience, and passion to our team – helping our customers to&amp;nbsp;out-predict, out-plan and outperform their competitors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tenured experience implementing Enterprise Performance Management solutions (Anaplan or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain expertise in planning and modelling in Finance solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead and consult on complex projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging (DEIB) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
