&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As part of our team, you will embody and help shape the following principles that define us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Forward Thinking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We embrace change and challenge the status quo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We take pride in our work and learn from our mistakes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Customer First&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We prioritize delivering lasting value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Unified Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We foster collaboration, respect, and integrity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strive for Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We set ambitious goals and pursue quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;We believe in a human hiring process, every application is personally reviewed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why is thinkcell the right place for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We empower over 1.3 million users across 35,000 companies, including top consulting firms and major global enterprises. With offices in Berlin, Munich, Denver, Boston, London, Tokyo, and Dubai, we’re a diverse team of over 240 people, committed to innovation and excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;thinkcell is more than a job – it&#39;s a chance to be part of an innovative, inclusive team that values collaboration and growth. We encourage applicants from all backgrounds to apply. Together, we can shape the future of productivity software. We can’t wait to see what you’ll bring to the team!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Good Systems is the parent company behind Goodnotes, where millions of people capture and develop their ideas.&lt;br&gt;Goodnotes is where we started, and it’s now the foundation for a growing family of products. By reimagining how we interact with information, we’re bringing together human creativity and the breakthrough capabilities of AI.&lt;br&gt;We build products that help people turn good thinking into good work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dream big&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be visionary, strategic, and open to innovation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build great things&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work in service of our users, always improving and pushing higher&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operate like an owner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take responsibility with bold decision-making and bias for action&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Win like a sports team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be trusting and collaborative while empowering others&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow fast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Never stop learning and iterate fast&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Share our passion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Share ideas and practice enthusiasm and joy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be user obsessed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Empathetic, inquisitive, practical&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;ui-markdown__heading ui-13ebx5f ui-x6cpbe ui-14l7nz5 ui-zboxd6 ui-2rll1g ui-1pz8kdr ui-1rrfizd ui-1qaq26d&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ui-markdown__paragraph ui-z80ra4 ui-uu7i3w ui-1nhcn8o ui-j7cesy ui-13faqbe ui-14l7nz5 ui-zboxd6 ui-1xxm6qq ui-fo6hhr&quot; data-md-next=&quot;list&quot;&gt;We&#39;re building some of our newest AI products at Good Systems, and we need creative, hands-on, AI-native marketers who can take a product from zero to its first users. You&#39;ll find the channels that work and scale them. You&#39;ll own acquisition end to end (positioning, messaging, launch, channels, creative) and do much of the work yourself, using AI to move at a pace a traditional team can&#39;t. This is a huge opportunity to be a key driving force behind our newest AI bets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ui-markdown__list ui-78zum5 ui-dt5ytf ui-1ae8yn7 ui-13vk20g ui-1e8yfua ui-j7cesy ui-1bae07f&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ui-markdown__list-item ui--default-marker ui-exx8yu ui-1xpa7k ui-18d9i69 ui-1uhho1l ui-13faqbe ui-ez2fb&quot; data-md-list-item=&quot;&quot;&gt;This role will be required to work on-site, 4 days per week in our London Paddington office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ui-markdown__list-item ui--default-marker ui-exx8yu ui-1xpa7k ui-18d9i69 ui-1uhho1l ui-13faqbe ui-ez2fb&quot; data-md-list-item=&quot;&quot;&gt;This is a 12-month fixed term contract, renewable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ui-markdown__list-item ui--default-marker ui-exx8yu ui-1xpa7k ui-18d9i69 ui-1uhho1l ui-13faqbe ui-ez2fb&quot; data-md-list-item=&quot;&quot;&gt;This role does not include visa sponsorship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;ui-markdown__heading ui-13ebx5f ui-x6cpbe ui-14l7nz5 ui-zboxd6 ui-2rll1g ui-1pz8kdr ui-1rrfizd ui-1qaq26d&quot;&gt;This is the role for you if you&#39;re excited to work on:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with channels and tactics, and learn fast what&#39;s worth investing in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive initial traction for a brand-new product with little budget and no built-in audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run acquisition loops across content, social, creators, community, partnerships, referral and paid&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape positioning and messaging for products still taking form, and test them in market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce copy, landing pages, video, creative, outreach and analysis yourself, and know when to bring in specialists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up your own funnel measurement and run weekly experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed what you learn back to Product and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you need to be successful:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re creative, hands-on and happy to get into the weeds, take ownership and experiment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve taken a product from 0 to its first users and can show exactly how&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re T-shaped: deep in one or two channels, competent across the rest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use AI daily and can name specifically what it replaced in your workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with ambiguity, think in numbers and write well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What Would be helpful but not required:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have prosumer or PLG experience, plus creator and community experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build in public and have an online presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seniority matters less than mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The interview process:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Intro Call:&lt;/strong&gt; A conversation with our Talent Acquisition team to dive into your experience, what motivates you, and why you&#39;re interested in joining Goodnotes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Manager Interview:&lt;/strong&gt; A deeper dive into your professional background, your preferred ways of working, and the specific impact you&#39;ll have within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role-Specific Assessment:&lt;/strong&gt; A live session in our London Paddington office, focused on the core skills for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Values-Based Panel Interview:&lt;/strong&gt; A conversation with 2-3 team members centred on our company values. We&#39;ll discuss past experiences to see how your approach aligns with our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; As an AI-first company, we&#39;ll meet with one of our AI champions to discuss your curiosity, understanding, and practical use of AI tools in your daily workflow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s in it for you:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customized Growth &amp;amp; Wellness Budgets:&lt;/strong&gt; We provide dedicated stipends for the things that keep you at your best, including noise-cancelling headphones for deep focus, professional training, personal development, and health and wellness activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Connectivity:&lt;/strong&gt; While we embrace flexible work, we love seeing each other. We provide sponsored visits to our beautiful office locations to foster face-to-face collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company-Wide Offsites:&lt;/strong&gt; Once a year, we gather the entire global team in person to celebrate our wins, align on our vision, and build lasting connections.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Health Coverage:&lt;/strong&gt; Your well-being is our priority. We offer premium medical insurance for you and a dependent to ensure peace of mind for you and your family.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4 days in-office hybrid week and 18 remote working days per year:&lt;/strong&gt; Giving you the freedom to work from a location that suits your life. Whether that&#39;s closer to family, while travelling, or simply a change of scenery to refresh your focus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Goodnotes is committed to fostering a diverse, inclusive, and equitable workplace. We welcome applications from individuals of all backgrounds, identities, and experiences, making all employment decisions based strictly on merit, qualifications, and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Employment is contingent upon successful completion of background checks, including verification of employment, education, and criminal records.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
