&lt;p&gt;As Vinted’s new Android Software Engineer, you’ll be joining the Android Technologies team. This is a team that provides Android support to Vinted developers in the marketplace business unit, helping them to develop and ship features faster. You will be working on exciting engineering areas like Android build systems, observability tools and coming up with technical solutions for platform stability and scalability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also support our Android Staff engineer and other technologies engineers in executing critical platform projects, moving us closer to achieving our company mission.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
